WEBVTT

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.277
and she tore open a yellow paper bag

00:00:31.319 --> 00:00:34.322
of slightly melted Sugar Babies.

00:00:34.363 --> 00:00:36.199
(Audience murmurs)

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.202
She poured a few of the pellets
into each of our tiny hands.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:40.828
Now, I want to be clear,

00:00:40.828 --> 00:00:43.247
this was not a normal mom thing.

00:00:43.289 --> 00:00:45.374
This was breaking several rules.

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:48.252
It was after lunch but before dinner,

00:00:48.252 --> 00:00:49.796
we were in the car,

00:00:49.796 --> 00:00:51.047
(Laughs)

00:00:51.089 --> 00:00:53.966
we hadn't done anything spectacular
to be celebrated.

00:00:54.425 --> 00:00:57.595
And Sugar Babies are, well, pure sugar.

00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:00.389
I was so confused.